# {{ .vars.service_name }}

{{ .vars.description | default "A production-ready microservice built with Go." }}

## Features

- RESTful API with OpenAPI specification
- gRPC support with Protocol Buffers
- PostgreSQL database with migrations
- Redis caching
- Kafka/RabbitMQ messaging
- Prometheus metrics
- Jaeger distributed tracing
- Structured JSON logging
- JWT authentication
- Docker and Kubernetes ready
- CI/CD pipelines

## Quick Start

### Prerequisites

- Go 1.22+
- Docker & Docker Compose
- Make

### Development

```bash
# Start dependencies
docker-compose up -d postgres redis

# Run migrations
make migrate-up

# Start server
make dev
```

### Testing

```bash
# Unit tests
make test

# Integration tests
make test-integration

# Load tests
make test-load
```

### Building

```bash
# Build binary
make build

# Build Docker image
make docker-build
```

